---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import joyImage from '../assets/people/joy-one-to-one.jpg';
import { organizationSchema, serviceSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout path="/one-to-one-sessions" schema={[organizationSchema, serviceSchema('One-to-one life and leadership coaching', '/one-to-one-sessions', 'One-to-one coaching for clearer, more courageous next steps in life, leadership, purpose and change.')] }>
  <section class="hero-copy section"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Coaching', href: '/coaching' }, { label: 'One-to-one coaching' }]} /><div class="split split--media"><div><p class="eyebrow">One-to-one life &amp; leadership coaching</p><h1>Lead change without losing sight of who you are.</h1><p class="lead">For people who feel called to lead change and want greater clarity, confidence and alignment between their values, faith and leadership.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a></div><Image src={joyImage} alt="Joy in conversation" width={640} densities={[1, 1.5]} sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" quality={60} /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>You can be capable, committed and still not know what comes next.</h2><p>Sometimes the problem is not a lack of ambition. It is that too many pressures, possibilities and expectations are pulling at once. Coaching gives you room to listen, notice what matters and take the next step.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>What you might explore</h2><div class="three-up"><p><strong>Purpose and direction</strong><br />Clarifying what matters and where to focus your energy.</p><p><strong>Leadership and confidence</strong><br />Working through obstacles, uncertainty and unhelpful patterns.</p><p><strong>Values and faith</strong><br />Connecting practical choices with what you believe and hope for.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--plan"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Clarity without prescription</p><h2>We won’t hand you a formula for somebody else’s life.</h2><p>Joy asks questions that help you think, notice and decide rather than telling you who to become. Insight matters, but so does turning it into practical goals, experiments and next steps.</p><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Tell us where you’re at.</strong><span>Come with a clear goal or simply explain what feels stuck, stretched or uncertain.</span></li><li><strong>Notice what matters.</strong><span>Explore calling, values, obstacles and the patterns shaping your choices.</span></li><li><strong>Move forward with clarity.</strong><span>Choose a practical next step that genuinely fits.</span></li></ol><p>Read more <a href="/about">about Joy’s experience and approach</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Related support</h2><p>Want to understand your natural patterns in more depth? <a href="/personality-discover-develop">Explore personality coaching</a>. Looking for whole-person, faith-aware reflection? <a href="/body-soul-spirit-reset">Explore Body Soul Spirit Reset</a>. Or <a href="/coaching">compare the coaching routes</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Questions people often ask</h2><details><summary>Who delivers one-to-one coaching?</summary><p>Joy leads this life and leadership coaching work. You can <a href="/about">read more about her experience and approach</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to know exactly what I want from coaching?</summary><p>No. The first conversation can help you name the question or change that feels most important.</p></details><details><summary>What will we clarify before we begin?</summary><p>We will talk through what feels stuck, stretched or uncertain, what you hope might change and whether one-to-one coaching is the most useful place to start.</p></details><details><summary>Is coaching the same as counselling?</summary><p>No. Coaching is a reflective, forward-looking conversation and is not a replacement for clinical, medical or therapeutic support.</p></details></div></section>
  <CallToAction title="A clearer next step can begin with a conversation." body="You do not need to know exactly what you need before getting in touch." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Start a conversation" />
</BaseLayout>
